{%- comment -%}
 Senseless — credentials line (single source).
 Factual brand-credentials statement, no efficacy. Aligned with the canonical compliance line
 in senseless-key-facts.liquid ("UK cosmetic product, by Matrix Health Group Ltd.").
 Render inline in any .liquid section, or via the senseless-credentials SECTION on JSON templates.
 Params:
  align — 'left' (default) | 'center'
  muted — true (default) renders in the muted/secondary colour; false = body colour
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
 assign al = align | default: 'left'
-%}
{%- style -%}
 .ss-cred { --p:#6B3FA0; --body:#2B2730; --sec:#5C5853;
  --sans:'Montserrat',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  font-family:var(--sans); font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:var(--sec); margin:0; }
 .ss-cred--body { color:var(--body); }
 .ss-cred--center { text-align:center; }
{%- endstyle -%}
<p class="ss-cred{% if muted == false %} ss-cred--body{% endif %}{% if al == 'center' %} ss-cred--center{% endif %}">A UK cosmetic by Matrix Health Group Ltd — formulated in the UK and safety-assessed under a Cosmetic Product Safety Report (CPSR).</p>
